stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> AVAILABLE : Asset created and added to inventory
    
    AVAILABLE --> ASSIGNED : Admin allocates to employee (assignedTo set)
    ASSIGNED --> AVAILABLE : Admin unassigns asset (clears assignedTo)
    
    AVAILABLE --> MAINTENANCE : Hardware defect / routine service
    MAINTENANCE --> AVAILABLE : Diagnostics & repair completed
    
    ASSIGNED --> MAINTENANCE : Device sent for urgent servicing (auto unassigned)
    
    AVAILABLE --> RETIRED : End of operational lifecycle (EOM / EOL)
    MAINTENANCE --> RETIRED : Decommissioned due to unrepairable fault
    
    RETIRED --> [*] : Archived hardware record (terminal state)
